{'symbol': 'EMR', 'date': '2023-03-14 09:00:00', 'title': "EMERSON SELECTED BY LODESTONE ENERGY TO AUTOMATE NEW ZEALAND'S FIRST LARGE-SCALE PHOTOVOLTAIC SOLAR POWER PROJECT", 'text': "UNIQUE RENEWABLE ENERGY PROJECT WILL SUPPORT THE NATIONAL EFFORT TO DECARBONIZE NEW ZEALAND'S ENERGY SECTOR AUSTIN, TEXAS , MARCH 14, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY AND SOFTWARE LEADER EMERSON (NYSE: EMR) WILL PROVIDE ADVANCED AUTOMATION SOLUTIONS TO HELP ENSURE THE SAFETY AND RELIABILITY OF NEW ZEALAND'S FIRST LARGE-SCALE SOLAR PHOTOVOLTAIC (PV) POWER PROJECT. EMERSON'S RENEWABLE POWER GENERATION EXPERTISE WILL HELP SOLAR ENERGY COMPANY LODESTONE ENERGY QUICKLY AND SAFELY COMPLETE ITS TWO 23-MEGAWATT SITES AT KAITAIA AND EDGECUMBE— AN IMPORTANT STEP IN SUPPORTING NEW ZEALAND'S AMBITIOUS GOALS OF ACHIEVING CARBON NEUTRALITY BY 2050."}